  <title>Drawing Canvas</title>
  <p>Choose <gui>View</gui> → <gui>Canvas</gui> to open a modeless drawing window beside the conversation. Closing it leaves saved revisions and recoverable working drafts in the session; it does not create a revision or discard a draft.</p>
